ld-4}} $\\le y$ {{field-5}} {{field-6}}." 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747305 1072 #uuid "010b6b83-9f96-5ddd-9bff-2bc2fa55fc10" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747305 1074 "Consider each coordinate separately.\n\nFor $x$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\cos\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiply by $2$ and translate by $-2$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n-2 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta\\le 2 \\\\\n-4 &\\le 2\\cos\\theta-2\\le 0 \\\\\n-4 &\\le x\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le x\\le 0$.\n\nFor $y$:\n\nOver the full turn, $\\sin\\theta$ attains both $-1$ and $1$, including at permitted parameter values.\n\nMultiplying by $-2$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-2$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n2 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta\\ge-2 \\\\\n0 &\\ge-2\\sin\\theta-2\\ge-4 \\\\\n-4 &\\le y\\le 0.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-4\\le y\\le 0$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value." 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747306 1080 "\\le" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747306 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747306 1083 #uuid "018af212-8eb3-53b6-ab91-52cf54516a05" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747307 1080 "-1" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747307 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747307 1083 #uuid "02c4123f-2830-54fb-8b91-0532fdcb9a85" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747308 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747458 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747308 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747308 1077 "field-3" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747308 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747458 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747308 10