alue $1$ is attained at $\\theta=\\frac{5\\pi}{2}$.\n\nMultiplying by $-4$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-1$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &<\\sin\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n4 &>-4\\sin\\theta\\ge-4 \\\\\n3 &>-4\\sin\\theta-1\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le y<3.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le y<3$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value." 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747349 1080 "-5" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747349 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747349 1083 #uuid "2a97f09d-696f-5019-89b3-dd8be339680e" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747350 1080 "-1" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747350 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747350 1083 #uuid "2b1d4b78-45c2-5cbd-adc9-d83dc88cb7d8" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747351 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747354 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747351 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747351 1077 "field-2" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747351 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747354 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747351 1079 #uuid "2cdad3c0-af7a-5fed-837d-c872fa25d755" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747352 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747422 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747352 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747352 1077 "field-8" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747352 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747422 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747352 1079 #uuid "2d3171e6-c39f-5f57-aba9-431939386799" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747353 1080 "<" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747353 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747353 1083 #uuid "2f172e3b-ffc1-