ta=\\pi$.\n\nThe value $1$ is attained at $\\theta=0$.\n\nMultiplying by $-3$ reverses both comparisons; translate by $-2$, then write the bounds in increasing order.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-1 &\\le \\cos\\theta\\le 1 \\\\\n3 &\\ge-3\\cos\\theta\\ge-3 \\\\\n1 &\\ge-3\\cos\\theta-2\\ge-5 \\\\\n-5 &\\le y\\le 1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus $-5\\le y\\le 1$.\n\nContinuity gives every value between the stated bounds. The coordinate extrema need not occur at the same parameter value." 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747433 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747463 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747433 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747433 1077 "field-2" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747433 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747463 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747433 1079 #uuid "9d716677-cf1d-5b38-b31d-8fb87372d75c" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747434 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747459 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747434 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747434 1077 "field-4" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747434 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747459 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747434 1079 #uuid "9eb91796-c4cc-5016-9981-fd020e15eaf9" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747435 1080 "5" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747435 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747435 1083 #uuid "9fe0010c-c47b-5d14-8047-96c790ec5f12" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747436 1075 #edb/ref 17592186747472 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747436 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747436 1077 "field-6" 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747436 1078 #edb/ref 17592186747472 13194139545113 17592186576411 true] [17592186747436 1079 #uuid "a129c702-2ff3-58b7-ad79-ebd1f5f5e3fd" 13194139545113 17592186576411 tru